 * Mark the quiz seed block containing `seedText` as posted on `date`.
 *
 * `seedText` is an exact substring of the seed (the batch entry's `seed`
 * field); matching is exact rather than fuzzy so a near-miss fails loudly
 * instead of marking the wrong block.
